{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22042","headline":"杂感 · 白居易","name":"杂感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子防悔尤，贤人戒行藏。\n嫌疑远瓜李，言动慎毫芒。\n立教固如此，抚事有非常。\n爲君持所感，仰面问苍苍。\n犬啮桃树根，李树反见伤。\n老龟烹不烂，延祸及枯桑。\n城门自焚爇，池鱼罹其殃。\n阳货肆凶暴，仲尼畏於匡。\n鲁酒薄如水，邯郸开战场。\n伯禽鞭见血，过失由成王。\n都尉身降虏，宫刑加子长。\n吕安兄不道，都市杀嵇康。\n斯人死已久，其事甚昭彰。\n是非不由己，祸患安可防。\n使我千载後，涕泗满衣裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}